Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10), python3-all, python3-setuptools, python3-wheel
Standards-Version: 3.9.3

Package: sonic-platform-nxp-lx2160ardb
Architecture: arm64
Description: SONiC platform support for the NXP LX2160ARDB
 Stable names for the DPAA2 network interfaces, so the SAI-VS lane map
 (device/nxp/arm64-nxp_lx2160ardb-r0) binds SONiC ports to the right DPMACs;
 the SONiC platform API (system EEPROM, temperature sensors); and the U-Boot
 environment location for fw_printenv/fw_setenv (sonic-installer).
